1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 13=

15
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,679
Zhao Feiyang?

16
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:02,960
What are you doing here?

17
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:03,880
If you can come,

18
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,000
why can't I?

19
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,319
Courting death?

20
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,519
How dare you talk to me like that?

21
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,200
Go ahead. Make a move.

22
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:10,599
You...

23
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,560
(Sword Immortal Inn)
Sirs.

24
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:15,159
Our inn

25
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,879
has rules.

26
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,680
Namely:

27
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:19,120
everyone here is a guest.

28
00:01:19,239 --> 00:01:20,480
No fighting is allowed.

29
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,120
If you want to fight,

30
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,280
take it outside.

31
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,359
He's a guest?

32
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,120
Do you know how much a night costs?

33
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:28,439
You're a worthless rogue cultivator
expelled from your sect.

34
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:29,359
Can you afford it?

35
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,319
Innkeeper,

36
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,719
How much for a Heaven Room?

37
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,319
A thousand spirit crystals.

38
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,000
That's expensive.

39
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:42,959
A worthless rogue cultivator like you

40
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:45,040
should just find a cave.

41
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:46,519
Don't embarrass yourself here.

42
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:47,920
Sir,

43
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,519
if you're a little short on funds,

44
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,920
you could consider an Earth Room.

45
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,799
It's only 500 spirit crystals.

46
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:57,120
Or a Human Room,

47
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:59,159
only 100 spirit crystals.

48
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,840
(The spirit crystals in my storage ring)

49
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:02,079
(are too many to count.)

50
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:04,079
(But I've been roughing it
for the past six months.)

51
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,159
(No need to waste them on this.)

52
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,439
Is there anything cheaper?

53
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,879
I only need a place for one night.

54
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,599
Well...

55
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:14,080
I know business isn't easy for you.

56
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,280
Pathetic.

57
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,639
Enough.

58
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:20,639
Innkeeper,

59
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,639
give him a Human Room.

60
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:23,840
A hundred spirit crystals?

61
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,199
Put it on my tab.

62
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:26,800
Well...

63
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:27,479
Cuihua,

64
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,759
why waste spirit crystals on a loser?

65
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,759
We were sectmates once, after all.

66
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:32,919
Since we've met again,

67
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,560
I can't just stand by, can I?

68
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:35,919
You're kindhearted.

69
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,199
Too bad,

70
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,759
he's nothing but an ingrate.

71
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:39,960
It's fine.

72
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,599
It's only 100 spirit crystals.

73
00:02:41,919 --> 00:02:43,240
Consider it lost.

74
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:48,159
Well...

75
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,680
I don't need your charity.

76
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,599
Innkeeper,

77
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,319
do you have anything cheaper?

78
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,479
If not, I'll leave.

79
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,599
Wait, sir.

80
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,360
If I really had to find you one,

81
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,280
I do have

82
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,719
a storage room.

83
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:02,800
It wasn't meant

84
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,080
for guests before.

85
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:06,240
We used to keep livestock in there.

86
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,680
But that was years ago.

87
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,560
The smell has long since faded.

88
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:12,680
It's just a little messy.

89
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,240
If you don't mind,

90
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:15,199
you see,

91
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:18,159
ten spirit crystals for the night.

92
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:20,080
Zhao Feiyang,

93
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,599
a room once housing beasts

94
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,719
is perfect for you!

95
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:24,439
Zhao Feiyang,

96
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,800
I know you're proud,

97
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:27,800
but you don't have to
endure this humiliation.

98
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,879
I don't need you to repay me.

99
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,319
Why put yourself through this?

100
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,039
Back when we were servant disciples,

101
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:36,039
let alone a room
that once housed beasts,

102
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,800
we even ate and lived with them,

103
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,840
didn't we?

104
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:41,919
If this counts as humiliation,

105
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,560
then your money

106
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,240
would be a graver insult.

107
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,039
You!

108
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,599
I warned you earlier.

109
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,080
Now you know.

110
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:51,719
Innkeeper.

111
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,319
Yes.

112
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,240
I'll take the storage room.

113
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:54,800
Sure.

114
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,400
Here you are, sir.

115
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:57,879
Waiter!

116
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,240
Coming!

117
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:59,400
Quick, show the way.

118
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,840
The storage room.

119
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,800
This way, sir.

120
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:02,879
Don't forget to collect
the spirit crystals.

121
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,800
I'd rather give them to a dog!

122
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:07,560
That jerk.

123
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:08,919
His cultivation is weak,

124
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,479
yet he acts so arrogant.

125
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:12,520
Qiushui,

126
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,560
after what he did to your father,

127
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:15,960
you're still tolerating him?

128
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,120
He and I are already even.

129
00:04:18,439 --> 00:04:20,560
We have no ties anymore.

130
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,240
Qiushui,

131
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,519
If you say so,

132
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,600
then that's a relief.

133
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,399
So from now on,

134
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,759
whatever I do to him,

135
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,199
you won't stop me, right?

136
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,800
Do as you please.

137
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:31,720
Good!

138
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,959
Qiushui, don't worry.

139
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,639
I'll get revenge for you.

140
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:38,519
Still,

141
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,519
why is he here?

142
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,439
Is he here

143
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:44,160
to enter the island too?

144
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,959
Only sect representatives

145
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,680
or imperial Holy Sons and Holy Maidens

146
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,120
may enter the island.

147
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,560
He has no backing.

148
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,439
So how can he get there?

149
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,560
True.

150
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,720
It's getting late.

151
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:59,120
Shall we still exchange
cultivation insights?

152
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,319
Yes!

153
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,879
Please, everyone.

154
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:11,519
I've been stuck for months
at Stage 4 of the Spirit Burst Realm.

155
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,639
Although I obtained

156
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,560
all those resources from the bandits,

157
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:16,240
I've still hit a bottleneck.

158
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:17,639
Today

159
00:05:18,639 --> 00:05:20,480
may be my chance to break through.

160
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:37,720
So this inn is built on a spirit vein.

161
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:38,879
Through a formation,

162
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,279
its spiritual energy

163
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,399
is channeled into every room.

164
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,839
That's why it costs so much.

165
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,160
The higher-grade rooms

166
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,079
may have even denser spiritual energy.

167
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,439
But he won't get my spirit crystals
that easily.

168
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,319
Since we're exchanging
cultivation insights,

169
00:06:15,879 --> 00:06:17,560
I do have a few things to say.

170
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:20,000
No point sharing insights.

171
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,839
We're all competitors.

172
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,040
I'm afraid it's hard to open up

173
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:25,720
and hold nothing back.

174
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:28,519
Holy Son,
then why did you gather us here?

175
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:29,839
What's the purpose?

176
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:32,800
To be frank,

177
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,000
I've studied

178
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,040
the spirit vein formation here.

179
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,319
If we can crack it,

180
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:38,519
then

181
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,160
we can directly absorb

182
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,639
the spirit vein's primal energy.

183
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:47,639
This inn has stood for centuries,

184
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,600
and you dare target it?

185
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:51,879
When I set out,

186
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:53,120
Sect Master warned me

187
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:54,680
not to cause trouble.

188
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,600
But don't you think

189
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,079
1,000 spirit crystals

190
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,439
was too much to pay?

191
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,639
This is the only inn
near Sword Immortal Island.

192
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,720
We spent over two weeks on a cloudship.

193
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,360
Plus, it's built on a spirit vein.

194
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,439
We need to rest up
before entering the island.

195
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,160
We have no choice.

196
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:10,959
So,

197
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,439
you're really okay with being fleeced?

198
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,439
What's your plan?

199
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:20,560
Nanyuan Kingdom's State Preceptor
knows formations inside and out.

200
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,240
I've learned quite a bit from him.

201
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,279
The spirit vein formation here

202
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,519
has been running for centuries.

203
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,879
Yet its spiritual energy
remains abundant.

204
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:29,480
So it must be
at least a high-grade spirit vein,

205
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,879
worth hundreds of thousands
of spirit crystals.

206
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,720
If you're willing to help,

207
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,879
I'm confident
we can weaken the formation.

208
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:36,879
Then,

209
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:38,920
each of us can absorb

210
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,120
a massive amount of spiritual energy.

211
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:51,079
Spirit veins are incredibly rare

212
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,439
on the Shenwu Continent.

213
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,839
Don't you want to seize

214
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,399
this chance to boost

215
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:58,439
your cultivation?

216
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:01,120
I think it's too risky.

217
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,560
But it's worth a try.

218
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:05,079
What if this gets exposed?

219
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,519
That innkeeper

220
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,120
seems to be quite powerful.

221
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,399
I've thought of that.

222
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,000
We won't get greedy.

223
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,959
We'll only absorb
half the spiritual energy,

224
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,839
then leave quickly.

225
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,240
By then,

226
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,439
I'll have Zhao Feiyang take the blame.

227
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,279
Well...

228
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,759
I don't need you to repay me.

229
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,240
Why put yourself through this?

230
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:27,079
Back when we were servant disciples,

231
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:29,959
let alone a room
that once housed beasts,

232
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,879
we even ate and lived with them,

233
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,919
didn't we?

234
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:35,960
If this counts as humiliation,

235
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,159
then your money

236
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,639
would be a graver insult.

237
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:39,519
You!

238
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,120
Fine.

239
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:45,080
Let's do it.

240
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,519
I'll go along with Junior Sister Qin.

241
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,000
Qiushui,

242
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:52,559
what do you think?

243
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:54,799
(It's half the spiritual energy
of a high-grade spirit vein.)

244
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,600
(If I take one-fifth of that,)

245
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:59,120
(I'll break through
to Stage 3 of the Spirit Burst Realm.)

246
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:00,360
(Zhao Feiyang,)

247
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,679
(I've treated you so well,)

248
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,759
(but you never cared.)

249
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,879
(Now that you're caught up in this,)

250
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,440
(fend for yourself.)

251
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:07,639
Fine.

252
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,879
I didn't expect anyone else

253
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,879
to be targeting the spirit vein.

254
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,080
But I'm sorry

255
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,039
you're too late.

256
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,639
Enter!

257
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,320
Such dense spiritual energy.

258
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,960
Then I'll help myself.

259
00:10:20,230 --> 00:10:23,850
(Spirit Burst Realm, Stage 9)

260
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,240
I accidentally drained
the entire spirit vein.

261
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:30,440
Thank goodness for my Dao Bone.

262
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:31,600
It withstood it all.

263
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,039
Stage 9 of the Spirit Burst Realm.

264
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:33,919
Not bad.

265
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,879
Five stages in one go.

266
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,120
This speed

267
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,240
would leave any prodigy

268
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,080
in the cultivation world stunned.

269
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,000
This is no place to linger.

270
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:43,799
I'm leaving.

271
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:49,399
What's going on?

272
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:50,919
We haven't even started.

273
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,759
So how did the formation break?

274
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,200
And the spirit vein's spiritual energy

275
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,639
seems completely drained.

276
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:56,639
It's ruined now.

277
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:57,919
What happened?

278
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,679
I...

279
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,840
I don't know either.

280
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,440
I thought breaking the formation

281
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,600
would take quite some time.

282
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:04,360
But...

283
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,720
(You're not going anywhere!)

284
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,559
Oh no. Leave now!

285
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,159
We're done for.

286
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,600
The inn is surrounded by a barrier.

287
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,759
We can't escape.

288
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:35,960
This barrier's level

289
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,320
(Cloud, Rank, Moon, Earth)
is beyond what we can break.

290
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,200
My sect told me not to cause trouble.

291
00:11:39,399 --> 00:11:39,799
I...

292
00:11:48,419 --> 00:11:52,049
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

293
00:11:52,206 --> 00:11:54,876
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

294
00:11:55,136 --> 00:11:58,686
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

295
00:11:58,866 --> 00:12:03,066
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

296
00:12:03,516 --> 00:12:06,766
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

297
00:12:07,136 --> 00:12:09,946
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

298
00:12:10,256 --> 00:12:13,636
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

299
00:12:13,766 --> 00:12:17,996
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

300
00:12:18,436 --> 00:12:21,566
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

301
00:12:21,856 --> 00:12:24,936
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

302
00:12:25,506 --> 00:12:28,346
♪With this flesh and soul♪

303
00:12:28,576 --> 00:12:31,596
♪I shall forge a new age♪

304
00:12:31,933 --> 00:12:35,003
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

305
00:12:35,253 --> 00:12:38,343
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

306
00:12:38,563 --> 00:12:40,793
♪At cultivation's peak♪

307
00:12:40,933 --> 00:12:44,773
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

308
00:12:45,183 --> 00:12:47,803
♪The sun and moon turn♪

309
00:12:47,823 --> 00:12:51,493
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

310
00:12:51,953 --> 00:12:58,733
♪I am the undying flame♪

311
00:12:59,413 --> 00:13:04,133
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

312
00:13:04,483 --> 00:13:07,663
♪At last I see, immortality♪

313
00:13:07,823 --> 00:13:12,463
♪Lives in your smiles♪
